'''High Tech '''is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Mystery Box 2]] or through [[trading]].

== Appearance ==
Its blade features this computer chip design that is primarily silver and blue in color. Dividing the edge from the blade’s fuller is the electrical blue stripe. On the fuller are two black screws, and three black lines overlapping the blue stripe. The guard is navy blue, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia==
*This is one of the few knives added alongside the [[Season 1]] update.
